# gettext -- msgfmt, and the reason glibc's contents were not deterministic.
#
# glibc compiles its message catalogues only if msgfmt is on PATH, and says
# nothing when it is not. Built in duct/chroot, which had gettext as a temporary
# tool, glibc shipped 39 locale files; built in duct/builder, which did not, it
# shipped none -- same recipe, same version, quietly different package.
#
# Packaging it makes the presence of msgfmt a property of the build environment
# we control rather than an accident of which image happened to run the build.
SRC_URL=$GETTEXT_URL
SRC_SHA256=$GETTEXT_SHA256
SRC_DIR=$GETTEXT_SRCDIR

CONFIGURE_ARGS="--disable-static"
